>> title: Tzatziki
>> category: Dressings & Dips
>> tags: yogurt, cucumber, greek, dip, no-cook
>> counters: Shawarma Counter
>> aka: tzatziki sauce, taziki, cucumber sauce, yogurt sauce
>> pairs-with: pita-bread
>> servings: 8
>> time: 35 min
>> step.1: salt and drain 20 min, squeeze dry
>> step.2: whisk together
>> step.3: fold in
>> step.4: season

Salt @cucumber{1%large}(coarsely grated) with @kosher salt{1%tsp} and drain in a #colander{} for ~{20%min}, then squeeze it dry in a towel.

Whisk @Greek yogurt{2%cups}(475 g; full fat) with @garlic{2%cloves}(grated), @extra-virgin olive oil{2%Tbs}, and @lemon juice{1%Tbs}.

Fold @&(~2)drained cucumber{} into @&(~1)yogurt{}.

Season @&(~1)tzatziki{} with @fresh dill{2%Tbs}(chopped), @fresh mint{1%Tbs}(chopped), and @black pepper{1/4%tsp}.
